Observed trend: as n grows (alpha fixed), ratio phi(n,c)/phi_infty(c)
moves towards 1, and the observed |ratio-1| stays well under the
script-01 asymptotic bound envelope at every tested point -- both
consistent with, and independent empirical support for, the closure
claim.
